Subject: [PATCH] Duplicate-payment prevention, admin footprint + certificates,
 weekly newsletter, safe course restructure

- Checkout: guests must give an email first; server refuses payment if that email (or the
  logged-in user) already owns the course; email locked into Stripe (customer_email);
  /api/request-access-link; idempotent flag_duplicate_payment() backstop for races, wired into
  guest/verify/webhook paths; unique stripe_session_id on flagged_payments; no conversion event
  for flagged duplicates; add missing `import sys`.
- Admin: per-user digital footprint (UserActivity log, /api/track, footprint modal) and a
  Certificates registry with exact re-rendered copies + PDF (snapshot columns on enrollments).
- Newsletter: double opt-in signup on Home, /newsletter confirm/unsubscribe page, admin tab
  (starter-draft generator, preview, test, send, queue, CSV), CRON_SECRET-protected weekly release.
- Courses: PUT /api/courses/<id> validates structure, remaps in-progress learners (clamp|reset),
  never touches completed learners, audit-logs; edit-mode JSON upload; player clamps position.
- Migration a1c3e5f7b9d2 (run BEFORE replacing course content).

